# Runtime data, logs and backups never go into the repository.
/data/
/backups/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
# Written by a release build (tools/deploy/release-info.mjs, the Dockerfile)
/release.json
# Dependencies
node_modules/
# Local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Program notes of the rebuild (plan, progress, evidence). They hold installation-specific and personal details, so
